Business Controls 

The solution includes several controls to keep recommendations reliable: 

Uses configured business rules and allowed actions. 

Validates mandatory input fields. 

Returns structured outputs instead of open-ended text. 

Provides confidence scores for decision support. 

Gives manual review guidance when data is missing or unclear. 

Can validate certain matches against Force.com where enabled. 

Keeps prompts and rules in storage so they can be governed centrally. 
